Based on the <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Intensity]</color> of all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Voidglow]</color>, deal Attribute Anomaly DMG to enemies at the corresponding multiplier of the skill, and increase this DMG Multiplier based on <color=#2BAD00>0.12%</color> of own Anomaly Proficiency;
